<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi all,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This is the Fullpass Test Report for Yocto 1.2 M4 RC1 bui=
ld. There are totally 36 bugs found in this testing, with 20 new bugs repor=
ted. All M4 testable features in 1.2 are covered in M4 RC1 testing, includi=
ng
 yocto-bsp/kernel, multilib, Hob, etc. More distributions are added into di=
stro testing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; BSP and QEMU targets work well without major issue. The o=
nly 2 new issues on BSPs are connman-property launch failure and no login v=
ia serial console on beagleboard. For Hob, there are 4 new bugs reported. M=
ost
 functions could work well in Hob, except that toolchain build could not wo=
rk; BB_NUMBER_THREADS and PARALLEL_MAKE could not work; template file and h=
ob-image .bb file has incomplete package information. For Core build system=
, there are 10 new bugs reported.
 Disk monitor and image build with PAM could not work. multilib, x32 and bu=
ild appliance could not work at all. For ADT, except for Clutter template c=
reation, most functions could work well. A new minor issue is reported for =
ADT installer with ppc.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For distribution testing, N&#43;1 testing is performed ag=
ainst CentOS/Ubuntu/Opensuse/Fedora. CentOS 5.x could not run bitbake due t=
o old version of python. Opensuse 12.2 M2 failed to compile m4-native.<o:p>=
</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For build performance, o</span><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=
=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">=
ne qemux86 sato build on a Core i7 machine costs 130 minutes, which saves 2=
% time than the result in
 1.2 M3 RC1 build(133 minutes).</span><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p></o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoPlainText"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;C=
ourier New&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang=3D"EN-US"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Not=
